SUMMARY:Fallen Angels by Noël Coward @ WTW St Austell
DESCRIPTION:Fallen Angels by Noël Coward (1h 50min)\n\nSparkling\, dizzying
 \, and deliciously potent\, Fallen Angels\, Noël Coward's champagne-fresh 
 comedy of bad manners\, shocked and delighted audiences at its 1925 premie
 re. Two upper-class wives\, their husbands away for the day\, share a few 
 toasts to their pre-marital dalliances-with the same man\, who just may be
  en route from France to visit. Old rivalries and past scandals bubble to 
 the surface in this intoxicating romp from one of theatre's comedy masters
 .\nStarring Golden Globe-winner Rose Byrne (If I Had Legs I'd Kick You) a
 nd Tony Award winner Kelli O'Hara (The King and I)\, with Tracee Chimo\, M
 ark Consuelos (making his Broadway debut)\, Christopher Fitzgerald and Aas
 if Mandvi\, this new Roundabout Theatre and Tony Award-winning production 
 of 'pure escapist fun' (The New York Times) was filmed live on stage at Br
 oadway's Todd Haimes Theatre and now comes to the big screen.\n\nFilm rele
 ase at WTW Cinemas St Austell\nBook tickets: https://wtwcinemas.co.uk/st-a
 ustell/film/5635/fallen-angels-by-nol-coward\n\nFilm details: https://even
 webb.github.io/wtw-cinemas/films/fallen-angels-by-no-l-coward.html
LOCATION:WTW Cinemas St Austell
URL:https://wtwcinemas.co.uk/st-austell/film/5635/fallen-angels-by-nol-cowa
 rd
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:63f70690497b3c65fded8d88f55b70c928ff36f4@wtw-cinemas
