SUMMARY:Swan Lake - Royal Ballet & Opera 26-27 Season @ WTW St Austell
DESCRIPTION:Swan Lake - Royal Ballet & Opera 26-27 Season (3h 25min)\n\nPri
 ncess Odette is bound by a curse\, turned into a swan by the evil sorcerer
  Von Rothbart. The spell can only be broken by a pledge of eternal love. W
 hen she meets Prince Siegfried\, he is immediately enamoured by her fragil
 e beauty and pledges to free her. But freedom is not promised for Odette a
 s Von Rothbart conspires to thwart the lovers' plans.\nLiam Scarlett's pr
 oduction for The Royal Ballet brings together Tchaikovsky's towering score
  and John Macfarlane's picturesque designs to create an enduring ballet sp
 ectacle of love\, treachery and forgiveness.\n\nFilm release at WTW Cinema
 s St Austell\nBook tickets: https://wtwcinemas.co.uk/st-austell/film/5563/
 swan-lake-royal-ballet-opera-2627-season\n\nFilm details: https://evenwebb
